{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Be part of a unique shooter where everyone is invisible by default!</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Ghosts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A ghost spawns at each player's location at set intervals. Use them to get a hint of where other players might be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/Invisibility_and_ghosts.gif?t=1742766234\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Revealing players</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are many different pieces of equipment to reveal other players, each working differently. Choose the right one for the right situation! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/Revealing.gif?t=1742766234\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game currently features 3 different game modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Capture</strong>: Collect, protect and steal gems to earn points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Elimination</strong>: Play as a team to eliminate the opposing team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deathmatch</strong>: Be the first to reach the target kill count.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/Game_modes.gif?t=1742766234\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game configs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each game mode can be configured individually to make every match feel unique. Combine different settings to make the game your own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883690/extras/Game_configs.gif?t=1742766234\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2883690?